Wireframe : Smart Hospital Queue Solution App

Wireframes (App Prototype & UI Design)
The Wireframes folder contains the complete visual representation and prototype of the Smart Hospital Queue Management App.

This section showcases how the designed solution is translated into an interactive and user-friendly interface aimed at improving
the patient waiting experience.

The prototype was designed using Figma, and the screens have been organized and presented using Canva for better visualization.
These wireframes demonstrate the key stages of user interaction, from login to receiving real-time updates and engaging with stress reducing features.

Key screens included in the prototype are:
1. Login Screen – User enters basic details to access the system.
2. Dashboard / Queue Status Screen – Displays real-time queue position, waiting time, and progress.
3. Quick Actions Screen – Provides access to Distraction Hub, Relax Mode, and Feedback.
4. Notifications Screen – Shows alerts such as queue updates and upcoming turn notifications.
5. Settings Screen – Allows users to manage notification preferences.

The design emphasizes:
1. Simple and intuitive navigation.
2. Real-time updates to reduce uncertainty.
3. Calming UI elements to reduce stress.
4. Accessibility for users of different age groups.

The prototype successfully integrates all compulsory features,including queue tracking, distraction hub, silent notifications,
mood based interactions, and feedback system.

